[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19862.628, "timestamp": "05:31:02", "text": "わーい。あなたは何をしようとしているのですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19863.708, "timestamp": "05:31:03", "text": "A"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19866.27, "timestamp": "05:31:06", "text": "猿。したい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19880.27, "timestamp": "05:31:20", "text": "待って、待って"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19884.75, "timestamp": "05:31:24", "text": "それ。私はそれと踊っているのだろうか？あ、待って。所有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19893.91, "timestamp": "05:31:33", "text": "ええ、踊っていますよ。見る？うん。うん。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19896.43, "timestamp": "05:31:36", "text": "動きがいい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19901.67, "timestamp": "05:31:41", "text": "うん。私を見て。私を見て、犬。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19919.51, "timestamp": "05:31:59", "text": "mov ああ、これは実際にうまくいきます。待って、待って、"}]